sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant API as CareerOS API
    participant Storage as StorageAdapter
    participant Engine as Document Intelligence Engine (kernel)
    participant Provider as DocumentExtractionProvider
    participant DI as document_intelligence_service (CareerOS)
    participant CDNA as Career DNA services (person/employment/skill_service)

    User->>API: POST /documents (upload PDF/DOCX)
    API->>Storage: store(person_id, filename, content)
    Storage-->>API: storage_ref
    API->>API: create Document(status=pending)
    API-->>User: Document (status=pending)

    User->>API: POST /documents/{id}/extract
    API->>Storage: retrieve(storage_ref)
    Storage-->>API: raw bytes
    API->>Engine: extract_text(document_type, bytes)
    Engine-->>API: plain text
    API->>Provider: analyze(document_type, text)
    Provider-->>API: ExtractionResult (with per-field confidence)
    API->>API: create DocumentExtractionRun(raw_extraction_json=...)
    API-->>User: DocumentExtractionRun (status=completed)

    User->>API: GET /documents/{id}/runs/{run_id}
    API-->>User: ExtractionResult (for review)

    Note over User,API: Human review happens here -- nothing<br/>written to Career DNA yet

    User->>API: POST /documents/{id}/runs/{run_id}/apply
    API->>DI: apply(extraction_result)
    loop for each ExtractedEmployment
        DI->>CDNA: employment_service.create_employment(..., attribution_source=AI_EXTRACTED)
    end
    loop for each ExtractedSkill
        DI->>CDNA: skill_service.add_person_skill(..., attribution_source=AI_EXTRACTED)
    end
    CDNA-->>DI: created records (dedup/ownership/validation enforced automatically)
    DI-->>API: applied summary
    API->>API: DocumentExtractionRun.applied_at = now()
    API-->>User: applied confirmation
